Any use intended to generate revenue, profit, commercial advantage, or monetary compensation of any kind is prohibited, regardless of whether the revenue is direct or indirect, and regardless of the form of compensation (including but not limited to: selling access, charging fees, subscriptions, advertising revenue, data monetization, or any other commercial benefit).

