## HolyMind Brand Protection Amendment

In addition to the restrictions above, you agree not to:

1. Publish, host, or distribute the software or any modified version of it publicly under the HolyMind name or using HolyMind branding, logos, or identifying marks without explicit written authorization from all copyright holders.

2. Present the software or any derivative work as an official version of HolyMind or as endorsed by HolyMind without written authorization from all copyright holders.

3. Use the HolyMind name or brand in any public distribution, marketing, or presentation of the software or modified versions thereof, except as required to accurately attribute the original work and comply with these license terms.

